{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "rewo-chat-api-collection",
    "name": "Rewo Chat API",
    "description": "Rewo API — Auth, Users, Conversations, Messages.\n\nBase URL: {{base_url}}\n\n1. Run **Auth → Sign up** or **Sign in** — tokens are saved automatically.\n2. Use **Users → List users** to find someone for a DM.\n3. Create a conversation, then send/list messages.\n\nWebSocket (realtime): `ws://{{base_url_host}}/ws/chat?token={{access_token}}`",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://140.245.8.15",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "base_url_host",
      "value": "140.245.8.15",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "access_token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "refresh_token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "user_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "other_user_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "conversation_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health check",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/health",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["health"]
            },
            "description": "Returns `{\"status\":\"alive\"}` when the server is up."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Sign up",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (json.access_token) pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', json.access_token);",
                  "  if (json.refresh_token) pm.collectionVariables.set('refresh_token', json.refresh_token);",
                  "  if (json.user && json.user.id) pm.collectionVariables.set('user_id', json.user.id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"user1@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Password1!\",\n  \"name\": \"User One\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/signup",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "signup"]
            },
            "description": "Password must include uppercase + special character."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Sign in",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (json.access_token) pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', json.access_token);",
                  "  if (json.refresh_token) pm.collectionVariables.set('refresh_token', json.refresh_token);",
                  "  if (json.user && json.user.id) pm.collectionVariables.set('user_id', json.user.id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"user1@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Password1!\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/signin",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "signin"]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Me (current user)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{access_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/me",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "me"]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Refresh token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (json.access_token) pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', json.access_token);",
                  "  if (json.refresh_token) pm.collectionVariables.set('refresh_token', json.refresh_token);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refresh_token\": \"{{refresh_token}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/refresh",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "refresh"]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Sign out",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{access_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refresh_token\": \"{{refresh_token}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/signout",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "signout"]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Users",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List users",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const users = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (Array.isArray(users) && users.length > 0 && users[0].id) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('other_user_id', users[0].id);",
                  "  }",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{access_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/users?limit=50",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "users"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "q",
                  "value": "",
                  "description": "Search by name or email",
                  "disabled": true
                },
                {
                  "key": "limit",
                  "value": "50"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Lists users except yourself. First result id is saved to `other_user_id`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Search users",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{access_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/users?q=john&limit=20",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "users"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "q",
                  "value": "john"
                },
                {
                  "key": "limit",
                  "value": "20"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Conversations",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List conversations",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{access_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/conversations",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "conversations"]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Create DM",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (json.id) pm.collectionVariables.set('conversation_id', json.id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{access_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"user_id\": \"{{other_user_id}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/conversations/dm",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "conversations", "dm"]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Create group",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (json.id) pm.collectionVariables.set('conversation_id', json.id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{access_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"Team Chat\",\n  \"member_ids\": [\"{{other_user_id}}\"]\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/conversations/group",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "conversations", "group"]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get conversation",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{access_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/conversations/{{conversation_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "conversations", "{{conversation_id}}"]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Add group member",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{access_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"user_id\": \"{{other_user_id}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/conversations/{{conversation_id}}/members",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "conversations", "{{conversation_id}}", "members"]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Messages",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List messages",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{access_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/conversations/{{conversation_id}}/messages?limit=50",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "conversations", "{{conversation_id}}", "messages"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "limit",
                  "value": "50"
                },
                {
                  "key": "before",
                  "value": "2026-08-16T10:00:00.000Z",
                  "description": "ISO timestamp for pagination",
                  "disabled": true
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Send message",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{access_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"body\": \"Hello from Postman!\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/conversations/{{conversation_id}}/messages",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "conversations", "{{conversation_id}}", "messages"]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "WebSocket (manual)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "README — WebSocket",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/health",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["health"]
            },
            "description": "Postman WebSocket: New → WebSocket Request\n\nURL:\n`ws://140.245.8.15/ws/chat?token={{access_token}}`\n\nSubscribe:\n```json\n{\"type\":\"subscribe\",\"conversation_id\":\"{{conversation_id}}\"}\n```\n\nSend message:\n```json\n{\"type\":\"message\",\"conversation_id\":\"{{conversation_id}}\",\"body\":\"Hello realtime!\"}\n```\n\nServer events:\n- `{\"type\":\"subscribed\",\"conversation_id\":\"...\"}`\n- `{\"type\":\"message\",\"message\":{...}}`\n- `{\"type\":\"error\",\"error\":\"...\"}`"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
